      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, but it feels a bit abstract. can u give me a more hands-on example or maybe a way to visualize it? like if i were looking at the air itself, what would i actually see happen at the wing surface to cause that pressure difference and the downward push? maybe a simple way to remember the relationship between the two?",
